OL,3,GNEWSACouncil leader calls for
OL,4,Areorganisation costs back
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council leader has called on the
OL,7,Fgovernment to reimburse local
OL,8,Fauthorities after plans to reorganise
OL,9,Flocal government were paused.
OL,11,FOn Monday, the government announced it
OL,12,Fwould be reviewing plans for 15 areas,
OL,13,Fincluding Leicester, Leicestershire and
OL,14,FRutland, where proposals had been
OL,15,Faccepted to expand the city boundary.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,364,360,200,160,0,100
