OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSACouncil leader calls for
OL,4,Areorganisation costs back
OL,5,
OL,6,FBen Taylor, Conservative leader of
OL,7,FBlaby District Council, welcomed the
OL,8,Freview, but in a letter to Local
OL,9,FGovernment Secretary Angela Rayner, he
OL,10,Furged the government to "fully
OL,11,Freimburse" councils for any costs
OL,12,Finvolved in the reorganisation process.
OL,14,FA government spokesperson said it would
OL,15,Fconsider costs on councils and how to
OL,16,Fsupport them through the "next stage".
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
